# Razor Chevreuse Fischl Bennett. ~17 or 20s Rot. Ignoring Razor's burst cooldown is ideal for DPS given fewer rotations. Pyro Infused Razor deals slightly more Pyro DMG; Echoes + Pyro > TS + ATK Goblet. Fischl snapshots Bennett's buff. Chevreuse is not buffed by Bennett.  Self overloads not implemented. 

# Team- Options listsed by DPS
razor char lvl=90/90 cons=6 talent=9,9,9;
razor add weapon="serpent" refine=1 lvl=90/90 +params=[stacks=5];
#razor add weapon="tidalshadow" refine=5 lvl=90/90; # VERY Behind
razor add set="echoes" count=4; # Ping Dependent
#razor add set="ts" count=4; 
#razor add set="glad" count=4;
#razor add set="cw" count=4;
#razor add set="gd" count=4; # AoE Reaction DMG; Self-overloads not implemented
